{
  "bodyHash": "08a47cc8af882a8e",
  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees</a> | <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/pams-harvestcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's HarvestCraft</a></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/740992844671746202/768498809894207548/header12.png\" alt=\"header\" width=\"588\" height=\"240\"></span></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模组将 Pam's HarvestCraft 的水果树替换为 Dynamic Trees 版本。&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>果树会长出自定义的水果方块，这些水果会随时间随机生长。当果实成熟时，右键点击即可收获（与 Pam's HarvestCraft 不同），收获后果实会消失，但一段时间后又会重新长出来。<br>本模组还添加了与 Serene Seasons 的兼容性！使用 Dynamic Trees 的季节适配器，你现在可以在一年中合适的季节收获你最喜欢的 Pam's HarvestCraft 水果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>Pam's HarvestCraft 2: Trees 的 Dynamic Trees 已发布！</strong></h4>\n<h4><strong>此页面<span style=\"color:#f00\">仅适用于 PHC 1</span>，且不再进行后续移植。对于 1.16 及更高版本，请使用 PHC 2</strong></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-pams-harvestcraft-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-pams-harvestcraft-2</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/83qcpkY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/376864341649129472/732384092401958983/Discord_software-Logo.wine.png?width=1442&height=395\" alt=\"discord icon\" width=\"191\" height=\"65\"></a><br>加入 Discord 服务器:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/83qcpkY\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/83qcpkY</a><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>当前包含的树木:</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 杏仁<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 杏<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 牛油果<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 香蕉<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 面包果<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 腰果<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 樱桃<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 栗子<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 肉桂<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 椰子<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 枣<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 火龙果（实际上是一种仙人掌）<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 榴莲<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 无花果<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 醋栗<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 葡萄柚<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 番石榴<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 榛子<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 菠萝蜜<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 柠檬<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 青柠<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 荔枝<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 芒果<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 枫树<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 肉豆蔻<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 橄榄<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 橙子<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 木瓜<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 纸树皮树<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 百香果（实际上是一种藤本植物）<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull;  Pawpaw（番荔枝科水果）<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 桃子<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 梨<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 山核桃<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 胡椒<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 柿子<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 开心果<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 李子<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 石榴<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 红毛丹<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 刺果番荔枝<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 受感染的橡树（蜘蛛网树）<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 杨桃<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 罗望子<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 香草豆<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; 核桃</p>\n<p><strong><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">世界生成:&nbsp;</span><span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✔️</span><br></span></strong>如果 Dynamic Trees 中的世界生成已启用，则会生成动态的 Pam's HarvestCraft 树木。<br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>常见问题解答<br></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>问</strong>: 为什么果实被收获后会消失？</p>\n<p><strong>答</strong>: 这是预期的效果，但不用担心，它会在一段时间后重新长出来。<br><br></p>\n<p><strong>问</strong>: 为什么我的果树上没有果实？</p>\n<p><strong>答</strong>: 树木必须长得足够大（特别是树干粗细）才能产生果实。小树不会产生果实。&nbsp;<br><br></p>\n<p><strong>问</strong>: 为什么骨粉不起作用？</p>\n<p><strong>答</strong>: 在本模组中，对果树使用骨粉不会使果实出现，也不会加速正在生长的果实成熟。<br><br></p>\n<p><strong>问</strong>: 我如何从枫树上采集枫糖浆？</p>\n<p><strong>答</strong>: 获取枫糖浆的正确方法是使用枫木集液管。方法是右键点击动态枫木原木并使用铁锭制作集液管。之后，可以挂上桶来随时间收集糖浆。<br><br></p>\n<p><strong>问</strong>: 我如何从纸树皮树上采集纸张？</p>\n<p><strong>答</strong>: 你可以用任何斧头右键点击原木来剥去树皮，从而获得纸张。<br><br></p>\n<p><strong>问</strong>: 我如何从肉桂树上采集肉桂？</p>\n<p><strong>答</strong>: 砍倒肉桂树时会掉落肉桂。<br><br></p>\n<p><strong>问</strong>: 我如何获得原始的 Pam's HarvestCraft 树苗？</p>\n<p><strong>答</strong>: 将种子或水果与泥土桶合成，以换取原始的 Pam's HarvestCraft 树苗。<br><br></p>\n<p><strong>问</strong>: 我能从果实中获得种子吗？</p>\n<p><strong>答</strong>: 将果实放入任何合成区域。<br><br></p>\n<p><strong>问</strong>: 你能为 X 模组制作插件吗？</p>\n<p><strong>答</strong>: 插件建议请在此处提交:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/supermassimo/DynamicTrees-ExC/issues/41\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/supermassimo/DynamicTrees-ExC/issues/41</a></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/740992844671746202/768503051325014076/unknown.png\" alt=\"passionfruit_wall\" width=\"748\" height=\"671\"></p>\n<p><span>百香果现在作为藤蔓生长！</span></p>\n<p>它的行为方式与普通藤蔓类似，但也会在上面长出果实。<br>要种植百香果种子，像往常一样点击方块的顶面，但确保附近有一个平坦的墙壁:<br><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/740992844671746202/768533555755745280/unknown.png\" alt=\"passionfruit_sapling\" width=\"289\" height=\"168\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/740992844671746202/768503672182800404/unknown.png?width=833&height=677\" alt=\"palm_trees\" width=\"750\" height=\"610\"></p>\n<p><span>欢迎棕榈树！</span></p>\n<p>正如许多人所知，枣和椰子都是棕榈树，因此现在看起来是这样的。小心椰子！<br><br><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/740992844671746202/768504268507709470/unknown.png?width=843&height=677\" alt=\"papaya_banana\" width=\"747\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p><span>木瓜和香蕉树，尽管在技术上不是棕榈树，但它们看起来非常像！</span><br>你会注意到香蕉树周围长着一些小型植物，它们是什么？<br>嗯，在现实生活中，大多数香蕉实际上是不育的，你不能从果实中种植它们，因为它们没有种子。<br>那么，该怎么办呢？人们是如何种植香蕉的？<br>答案就在前面提到的那些小型植物上，称为香蕉吸芽。<br>这些可以被收获并重新种植到其他地方，以创建全新的香蕉树。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/740992844671746202/768505595707260938/unknown.png?width=969&height=677\" alt=\"dragonfruit\" width=\"753\" height=\"526\"></p>\n<p><span>这些看起来奇怪的奇特树木是什么？</span><br>嗯，那是火龙果仙人掌！<br>果实会在它们周围生长以便轻松采摘，但要小心，不要靠得太近，以免被多刺的植物扎伤！<br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>其他 Dynamic Trees 插件:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-the-aether-legacy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Legacy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-atum-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Atum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dtbop\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty<br></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-corvus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Corvus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-for-cuisine\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cuisine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-defiled-lands\" rel=\"nofollow\">Defiled Lands</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-extra-utilities-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extra Utilities 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forbidden and Arcanus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-forestry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forestry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-heat-and-climate\" rel=\"nofollow\">Heat and Climate</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-industrial-craft-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Industrial Craft 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-integrated-dynamics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Dynamics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-mystical-world\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mystical World</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-natura\" rel=\"nofollow\">Natura</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-natures-aura\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Aura</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dtphc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Harvestcraft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-pams-trees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Trees</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-roots\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roots</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-sugi-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sugi Forest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-tech-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tech Reborn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictreestfc\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaCraft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dttc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thaumcraft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-thaumicraft-addons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thaumcraft Addons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-the-betweenlands\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Betweenlands</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-tinkers-construct\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tinker's Construct</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-totemic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Totemic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-traverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traverse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Forest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-vampirism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vampirism<br></a><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>要求:</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.12.2 的 Dynamic Trees<br></a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/pams-harvestcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.12.2 的 Pam's Harvestcraft</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>模组兼容性请求:</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需请求新增模组兼容性，请在此处提交！！</span></p>\n<p>1.12:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/DynamicTreesTeam/DynamicTrees/issues/652\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/DynamicTreesTeam/DynamicTrees/issues/652</a><br>1.16:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/DynamicTreesTeam/DynamicTrees/issues/653\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/DynamicTreesTeam/DynamicTrees/issues/653</a><br>在 CurseForge 评论部分提出的任何建议都<strong>不会</strong>被考虑在内（抱歉！）<br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>模组包:</strong></span></p>\n<p>- 你可以在任何你想要的模组包中使用它！无需询问。<br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>评论:</strong></span><br>要添加评论或报告问题，请加入 Discord 服务器&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/83qcpkY\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/83qcpkY</a></p>",
